1. Yes, I saw that chain is successfully getting constructed when I debugged with  X509Chain.Build.
    ```c#
   X509Chain chain = new X509Chain();
   chain.ChainPolicy.VerificationFlags = X509VerificationFlags.AllFlags;
   chain.ChainPolicy.RevocationMode = X509RevocationMode.NoCheck;
   chain.ChainPolicy.DisableCertificateDownloads = false;
   bool status = chain.Build(c);
      ```
      
      Used above policy flags and observed that chain.elements are successfully getting populated with intermediate certs.
      The chain status is "Partial Chain".
      
